WEBVTT

00:00:27.063 --> 00:00:31.263
He wants to listen,
be heard and understand.

00:00:31.863 --> 00:00:34.763
And over two weeks,
he has hundreds of conversations

00:00:34.763 --> 00:00:37.730
with Americans from
New Hampshire to Miami.

00:00:37.763 --> 00:00:40.630
Some of them are tough conversations,

00:00:40.630 --> 00:00:43.363
complete differences of opinions,

00:00:43.397 --> 00:00:45.897
wildly different worldviews,

00:00:45.930 --> 00:00:49.063
radically opposite life experiences.

00:00:49.397 --> 00:00:51.163
But in all of those interactions,

00:00:51.197 --> 00:00:53.797
Dad walks away
with a big smile on his face

00:00:53.830 --> 00:00:55.797
and so does the other person.

00:00:55.830 --> 00:00:57.997
You can see one of them here.

00:00:58.030 --> 00:01:00.430
And in those interactions,